    demonstration of the value of 64
    bit capability requires a real
    hardware platform. If current
    schedules hold, we may begin to see
    production-quality IA64 systems in
    2000, and we would expect that
    development work would gradually
    transfer to those systems. But in
    the near term, and for a while to
