need a lot marketing due to its press profile. As long as the news-hounds keep
talking it up, why waste ad. dollars?

2. Only those who are truly hell-bent on W/NT will shift their orders from
Alpha-NT over to Intel+SMP servers instead.

Seems to me that Compaq is taking to the bank an empty purse.

