Stephen,

As far as I know, the only main logic board capable of handling dual
processors is the one with the 54-23606-01 part number.  This board is
found in the Celebris XL, but it may also have crept into some of the
later DECpc XLs made just before DEC changed the plastic face plate on
the front (and not much else).

If you have an earlier main logic board with a lower part number, I
don't think duals are possible... Ben Myers

