While there's not much else to do, I'd agree that waiting for results
is the proper course to take.  However, for VMS, the hour is late, and
sooner will be much better than later.

If Michael has really gotten the point, then the next thing to do is to
first get the sales force in the right frame of mind, and then have them
call on all current VMS shops, and maybe some prior VMS shops (in case
