assuming myprog resides in drive:[dirspec], yo can use either of:

$mc  drive:[dirspec]myprog -i param1 -a param2

or

$mycmd :== $drive:[dirspec]myprog.exe     ! define a foreign command
then use
$mycmd -i param1 -a param2

