MISC1.  What is the pinout for the DECconnect DEC-423 MMJ connector?

DECconnect DEC-423 MMJ pinout:

    1 Data Terminal Ready (DTR)
    2 Transmit
    3 Transmit Ground
    4 Receive Ground
    5 Receive
