-toolargs="-fork" is needed to emit the .Counts files for forked
processes.  The -pids option is used for multiple invocations on the
pixified application.

% atom -tool pixie test -toolargs="-fork"
% setenv LD_LIBRARY_PATH .
% test.pixie
% ls
libc.so.test.pixie   test.Addrs           test.Counts.16242    test.cxx
test*                test.Counts          test.Counts.16243   
test.pixie*

Gail



